Clarify the requirements of this feature and write its PRD.

Feature ({{.input.feature}}): {{.input.task}}

Read the project checkout first (README, existing docs) so your questions are specific. Before writing anything, list every ambiguity, missing acceptance criterion, unstated user or unclear scope boundary, and ask the operator about each one with the ask_operator tool (at most three questions per turn; group related points). Do not guess an answer you could ask for. Then write docs/plans/{{.input.feature}}/PRD.md: problem, users, goals and non-goals, numbered requirements each with an acceptance criterion, and the operator's answers. Anything still unresolved goes in open_questions. Finish with prd_path (docs/plans/{{.input.feature}}/PRD.md), a summary of two or three sentences and open_questions (empty when none).

